# Import prompts

# Prompt
This is the main class for various additional checks on *.svi files in the project.
This class calls all the checks one by one, collects the results and messages, and
returns the overall result.
Each elementary check is contained in a separate class whose name starts with 
SviCheck*. Each check class implements the OneSviCheck interface with method check.

* method check
Algorithm:
1. Loop through all check classes; you can find names of these classes from
the dependencies;
2. Run each check, get its results as 'checkResults'
3. For each result, save errors to a class attribute
4. When all the checks have been executed, return the overall result: true only
if all the checks are successful, otherwise false.

* method logErrors
Loop through all the error messages stored in the 'check' method and log them
with the logger.error

Additional guidelines:
When importing single check classes, please import them correctly considering
export default (without curly brackets) or just export (with curly brackets),
don't make mistakes.